Improvement Guidance1: Modify `ProfileManager` to either overwrite existing profiles or return the latest version of a profile. Decide whether profiles should support versioning or overwrites.  
Failure Analysis2: Form submission refreshes the page, causing `StaleElementReferenceException` in tests.  
Improvement Guidance2: Ensure form submissions either redirect to a new page (tests must re-locate elements) or use AJAX to avoid full page reload.

3. |Case|:**user_login**  
Failure Analysis1: Test expects title "Content Feed", but template has "Feed".  
Improvement Guidance1: Either update test expectations or template to match. Ensure UI consistency (e.g., standardized page titles).  
Failure Analysis2: Test expects "Invalid username or password" feedback, but the message doesn＊t appear.  
Improvement Guidance2: Add flash message rendering in `login.html` to show validation errors. Avoid revealing whether the username exists (e.g., use generic "Invalid credentials").

4. |Case|:**user_registration**  
