Improvement Guidance1: Modify `login.html` to include a dedicated "Register" button or ensure the test matches the exact link text.  
Failure Analysis2: Test fails waiting for the registration page to load (`TimeoutException`).  
Improvement Guidance2: Use explicit waits for critical elements (e.g., registration form) rather than title checks. Ensure Flask serves pages efficiently (no blocking operations in routes).

5. |Case|:**user_interaction**  
Failure Analysis1: Test explicitly fails because functionality is missing.  
Improvement Guidance1: Implement interactions (follow/message) with `followers.txt` to track relationships and a messaging system with `messages.txt`, or remove the test case to avoid false negatives.
