## Experience and Lessons
|Case|:content_discovery  
Failure Analysis1: Test expects oldest post first, but `get_feed()` returns newest first.  
Improvement Guidance1: Ensure test expectations match implementation (reverse chronological order). Document feed ordering behavior clearly in requirements.

2. |Case|:profile_management  
Failure Analysis1: `update_profile()` appends new entries instead of updating existing ones. `get_profile()` returns the first match, ignoring updates.  
Improvement Guidance1: Modify `ProfileManager` to either overwrite existing profiles or return the latest version of a profile. Decide whether profiles should support versioning or overwrites.  
Failure Analysis2: Form submission refreshes the page, causing `StaleElementReferenceException` in tests.  
Improvement Guidance2: Ensure form submissions either redirect to a new page (tests must re-locate elements) or use AJAX to avoid full page reload.

